                            <div id="content" class="content" role="main" itemprop="mainContentOfPage">

                                <h1 class="entry-title" itemprop="headline">RE+ Special Edition 2023</h1>

                                <div class="entry-content">
                                                                        <p>On the occasion of RE+ 2023 in Las Vegas, pv magazine is publishing a special edition on the latest developments in the U.S. photovoltaic market.</p>
<p><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-226364 alignleft" src="https://www.pv-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Cover-SE-Las-Vegas.jpg" alt="Special Edition USA Las Vegas" width="249" height="323" /></p>
<div class="elementToProof">This special issue is a guide to the current and future status of the clean energy industry in the United States in the year following passage of the landmark Inflation Reduction Act.</div>
<p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li class="elementToProof">State policies reshape distributed solar</li>
<li class="elementToProof">Critical roles for long-duration energy storage</li>
<li class="elementToProof">Manufacturing a solar-powered economy</li>
<li class="elementToProof">Spotlight on Canada</li>
<li class="elementToProof">A hydrogen-powered microgrid at RE+ 2023</li>
<li class="elementToProof"><span class="ContentPasted0">and more&#8230;</span></li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
